/**
 * Single source of truth for the /api/d2/ops-reporting dispatch tables.
 *
 * - `OPS_POST_ACTIONS` is the POST allowlist: `route.ts` rejects any other `action`
 *   with 400 "unknown action", and every entry must reach a POST handler
 *   (enforced by tests/api.ops-reporting.dispatch-coverage.test.ts).
 * - `OPS_GET_VIEWS` is the set of accepted `view` query values: `route.ts` derives
 *   its `View` type and `parseView` from it, and every entry must reach a GET
 *   handler that answers with the same view name (same test file).
 *
 * - `OPS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED_ACTIONS` are known action names whose handlers were removed
 *   because their row lookups are not specific to their own governance chain (or do
 *   not exist). `route.ts` answers them with 501 `{ error: "not_implemented", action }`
 *   instead of risking a write to another chain's row.
 *
 * Add new actions/views here (one line each) in the same change that adds the handler.
 */

